  "subject": "✉️ Last week on the Forsured blog: Nov 23 to 29",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\"/><title>Last week on the Forsured blog, Nov 23 to 29</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#FAFBFA\" bgcolor=\"#FAFBFA\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">One new post: COI tracking spreadsheet, outsourced service or software: which should a GC use?</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#FAFBFA\" bgcolor=\"#FAFBFA\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #E4E7EC;border-radius:12px;border-top:4px solid #FB612A\">\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\n    <a href=\"https://forsured.ai/blog/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=subscriber&amp;utm_campaign=weekly\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.5px;color:#0A0A0E;text-decoration:none\">Forsured</a>\n    <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#555555;padding-left:8px\">Blog</span>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#0A0A0E\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px\">Hi there,</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0\">Here's what we published last week (Nov 23 to 29): one new post, each in a few lines. Open the ones that matter to your projects. ✉️</p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;border:1px solid #E4E7EC;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#344051\"><span style=\"color:#FB612A\">●</span> Buyer's guide · 6 min read</span>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3\">✏️ <a href=\"https://forsured.ai/blog/coi-tracking-spreadsheet-service-or-software/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=subscriber&amp;utm_campaign=weekly\" style=\"color:#0A0A0E;text-decoration:none\">COI tracking spreadsheet, outsourced service or software: which should a GC use?</a></p>\n    <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#555555\">A COI tracking spreadsheet works while you have a few contractors, one set of requirements and someone who reads every endorsement. Outsource COI tracking when you need hands, not judgment. Use COI tracking software when requirements change by project, contractors work several jobs, and you want the broker fixing gaps fast.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#0A0A0E\">✅ A COI tracking spreadsheet tracks dates well. It can't read an endorsement or hold different requirements for each project, so a person has to do both by hand for every contractor COI.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#0A0A0E\">✅ When you outsource COI tracking, you buy capacity: collection, reminders and follow-up. Ask exactly what the service's reviewers read and who signs off, because the gap is still yours if it's missed.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:15px\"><a href=\"https://forsured.ai/blog/coi-tracking-spreadsheet-service-or-software/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=subscriber&amp;utm_campaign=weekly\" style=\"color:#FB612A;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Read the post →</a></p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:20px 32px 0\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#FFF8F4\" style=\"background-color:#FFF8F4;border-left:3px solid #FB612A;border-radius:8px\">\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 20px;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#0A0A0E\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#344051\">&#x1F381; Free COI risk check</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0\"><strong>No strings attached.</strong> Send us one project's requirements and a contractor COI or two, and we'll walk you through every gap we find. <a href=\"https://forsured.ai/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=subscriber&amp;utm_campaign=weekly#demo\" style=\"color:#0A0A0E\">Get yours →</a></p>\n      </td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 32px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#0A0A0E\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0\">Questions, or a topic you want us to cover? Just hit reply. It comes straight to me.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0\"><strong>Zach Servideo</strong><br/><span style=\"color:#555555;font-size:14px\">Founder / CGO<br/>Forsured</span></p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 32px 24px;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#555555;border-top:1px solid #E4E7EC\">\n    <p style=\"margin:20px 0 0\">You're getting this because you signed up for the Forsured weekly newsletter on the <a href=\"https://forsured.ai/blog/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=subscriber&amp;utm_campaign=weekly\" style=\"color:#555555\">Forsured blog</a>. Not for you anymore? <a href=\"%%UNSUBSCRIBE%%\" style=\"color:#555555;font-weight:600\">Unsubscribe</a> in one click, or reply \"stop.\"</p>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
